OL,3,GNEWSATheatre increases capacity after
OL,4,A#277k renovation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre has increased its capacity
OL,7,Ffollowing a #277,000 renovation.
OL,9,FAll 855 seats at the Alban Arena were
OL,10,Freplaced during the works, which began
OL,11,Fin September 2025, and were funded by
OL,12,Fowner St Albans City and District
OL,13,FCouncil and operator Everyone Active.
OL,15,FThe new red velvet seating has
OL,16,Fincreased the venue's capacity to 902,
OL,17,Fwith more wheelchair spaces also added.
OL,19,FJo Ditch, theatre contract manager for
OL,20,FEveryone Active, said it was
OL,21,F"fantastic" the project was complete.
